      "path": "20-Learning/protocol/mcp.md",
      "title": "Model Context Protocol transports",
      "aliases": ["MCP 协议", "tool transport contract"],
      "tags": ["agent", "protocol"],
      "date": "2026-06-10",
      "type": "learning-note",
      "body": "MCP connects tool servers through stdio or Streamable HTTP. The transport does not grant the server permission to edit unrelated files."
    },
    {
      "path": "30-Insights/retrieval/local-embedding.md",
      "title": "Local embedding trade-off",
      "aliases": ["向量检索决策"],
      "tags": ["retrieval", "privacy"],
      "date": "2026-07-29",
      "type": "insight-note",
      "body": "Version one keeps lexical retrieval. A semantic vector provider remains optional and disabled until a measured recall gain justifies its index and runtime cost."
    },
    {
      "path": "40-Projects/knowledge-skill-architecture.md",
      "title": "Knowledge Skill architecture",
      "aliases": ["双 Skill 方案"],
      "tags": ["obsidian", "architecture"],
      "date": "2026-06-09",
      "type": "project-note",
      "body": "Read-only retrieval and governed writing are separate Skills. Search never inherits save permission; explicit save intent enters an independent preflight."
    },
    {
      "path": "20-Learning/retrieval/bm25.md",
      "title": "BM25 lexical ranking",
      "aliases": ["词法排序"],
      "tags": ["retrieval", "ranking"],
      "date": "2026-07-28",
      "type": "learning-note",
      "body": "Title and alias fields receive more weight than tags, headings, links, and body text. Scores order results and do not express factual confidence."
    },
    {
      "path": "20-Learning/backend/cache-stampede.md",
      "title": "Cache stampede control",
      "aliases": ["缓存击穿", "single-flight guard"],
      "tags": ["cache", "backend"],
      "date": "2026-05-12",
      "type": "learning-note",
      "body": "Synchronized expiry causes concurrent misses and duplicate backend recomputation. A per-key single-flight guard lets one caller refresh while others reuse the result."
    },
    {
      "path": "20-Learning/backend/sse-proxy.md",
      "title": "SSE reverse proxy buffering",
      "aliases": ["Server-Sent Events 代理延迟", "Nginx SSE"],
      "tags": ["sse", "nginx"],
      "date": "2026-06-11",
      "type": "learning-note",
      "body": "Server-Sent Events can appear delayed when a reverse proxy buffers chunks. Disable response buffering for the event route and verify incremental delivery."
    },
    {
      "path": "40-Projects/database/schema-migration.md",
      "title": "Zero-downtime schema migration",
      "aliases": ["expand-contract migration"],
      "tags": ["database", "migration"],
      "date": "2026-05-20",
      "type": "project-note",
      "body": "Add the compatible column first, deploy dual reads and writes, backfill, verify, then remove the old field in a later release."
    },
    {
      "path": "20-Learning/python/uv-lock.md",
      "title": "Reproducible Python environments with uv",
      "aliases": ["uv 锁文件决策"],
      "tags": ["python", "tooling"],
      "date": "2026-07-07",
      "type": "learning-note",
      "body": "Pin the interpreter, commit uv.lock, sync with --locked, and keep pytest in the dev extra so local and CI dependency resolution agree."
    },
    {
