      "aliases": ["目录索引图谱"],
      "tags": ["obsidian", "navigation"],
      "date": "2026-07-08",
      "type": "learning-note",
      "body": "A folder-named index is the plugin-owned navigation node. Replacing it with a generic INDEX filename can disconnect parent and child graph edges."
    },
    {
